 ## Unreleased
 
 - `Schedule.cancel(appointment_id)` marks an appointment as cancelled. It stays on record and no longer blocks its slot.
+- `Schedule.free_slots(therapist, day, minutes)` lists the start times, every 15 minutes from opening, at which an appointment of that length fits the therapist's day. It follows the same clash and cleanup-gap rules as `book()`.
 
 ## 0.1.0
 
